# =============================================================================
# ROAS — master secrets template (fill once, paste to Vercel / Fly / Railway)
# =============================================================================
#
# SETUP:
#   cp scripts/roas/roas-secrets.env.template scripts/roas/roas-secrets.env
#   Fill scripts/roas/roas-secrets.env with real values (from LastPass / dashboards)
#
# NEVER commit roas-secrets.env — it is gitignored.
# This .template file stays in git with placeholders only.
#
# After filling, paste sections into:
#   • Vercel → roas-api / roas-web / roas-funnels → Settings → Environment Variables
#   • Fly → roas-runtimes → Secrets
#   • Railway → roas-workers → each service → Variables
#
# Legend:
#   [P2 REQUIRED]  = needed for first production deploy (api + web + basic smoke test)
#   [P2 AGENTS]    = needed for Fly agent-api / OpenClaw / workers
#   [LATER]        = skip until that feature ships
#   → targets      = where to paste this var in production
#
# Provisioning doc: .docs/plans/roas-lovable-rebuild-provisioning.md
# =============================================================================


# =============================================================================
# 1. SUPABASE — roas-production (lhfgtsjetcardinpgouq)
# =============================================================================
# [P2 REQUIRED] → Vercel roas-api, roas-web, roas-funnels | Fly | Railway workers

SUPABASE_URL=https://lhfgtsjetcardinpgouq.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET=

# Direct Postgres — Cursor migration scripts + optional API advisory locks
# [P2 REQUIRED for scripts] → scripts/roas/.env (DATABASE_URL only) OR copy here
DATABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_DIRECT_DB_URL=   # optional pooler URI for API


# =============================================================================
# 2. ROAS PRODUCTION URLS (not secrets — same on all services)
