# =============================================================================
# 10. RAILWAY roas-workers — PASTE BLOCK (mission-worker + queue-worker)
# =============================================================================
#
# WHERE TO PASTE
#   Railway → project "roas-workers" → service → Variables → Raw Editor
#   Paste this ENTIRE block (KEY=VALUE lines only) into BOTH:
#     • mission-worker
#     • queue-worker
#   Steps: delete placeholder text → paste block → Update Variables → redeploy service
#
# REDIS_URL (critical)
#   Workers MUST use Railway INTERNAL Redis — not the public URL on Vercel roas-api.
#   Preferred (Railway resolves automatically):
#     REDIS_URL=${{Redis.REDIS_URL}}
#   Replace "Redis" if your Redis service has a different name in the Railway project.
#   Do NOT paste .proxy.rlwy.net or other public Redis URLs here.
#
# Same values on both worker services. COMPOSIO_API_KEY is required by
# queue-worker at boot (Composio init); harmless extra on mission-worker.
#
REDIS_URL=${{Redis.REDIS_URL}}
SUPABASE_URL=https://lhfgtsjetcardinpgouq.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_URL=https://roas-runtimes.fly.dev
OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN=
INTERNAL_API_TOKEN=
BACKEND_URL=https://api.roas.io
MISSION_CALLBACK_URL=https://api.roas.io
OPENCLAW_MODEL_PREFIX=openclaw
MISSIONS_BATCH_SIZE=20
MISSIONS_EXECUTION_TIMEOUT_MS=1800000
PORT=3005
COMPOSIO_API_KEY=


